{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>וישר</b> — the meaning: how he struggled with Elohim." "<b>ויוכל</b> — the angel, and he almost wept and implored him to let him go. And the meaning of עלות השחר — before the light grows strong, for it was not the time of Jacob. [n: 'for it was not the time of Jacob' is hyper-literal; the phrase is elliptical and possibly obscure.]" "And the meaning of בית אל ימצאנו — upon his return to his father, there he found the angel. And because the angel appeared at Bethel twice, behold the place is the gate of heaven; therefore I and Amos prophesied against Jeroboam at Bethel, which is the place of his kingdom, as I shall explain."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:00.927378321Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}